    "name": "Condemned: No Escape",
    "steam_appid": 3307350,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>ADD TO WISHILIST</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/extras/585c280d28261325ada68a0faa266ae0.poster.avif?t=1748011806\" width=720 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/extras/585c280d28261325ada68a0faa266ae0.webm?t=1748011806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/extras/585c280d28261325ada68a0faa266ae0.mp4?t=1748011806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a world of adventure and puzzles in this game that pays tribute to the Game Boy era!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/extras/047ada9317048497f59bcfa3927fec83.poster.avif?t=1748011806\" width=582 height=516 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/extras/047ada9317048497f59bcfa3927fec83.webm?t=1748011806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/extras/047ada9317048497f59bcfa3927fec83.mp4?t=1748011806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a mysterious place filled with secrets and challenges. Your mission is to use all your reasoning skills to discover the best strategy to collect keys, unlock doors, and reach the exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Each level brings new obstacles, requiring you to think creatively and quickly to overcome barriers and uncover hidden secrets.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a nostalgic and challenging experience, where every move counts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The path is full of dangers: holes, spikes, traps, destructive platforms, and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jumping on destructive platforms requires attention, as they disappear right after contact. Treacherous holes and hidden traps make every step a critical decision. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically placed levers unlock new areas, adding an extra layer of strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/extras/00360ab16c541913c0b96835d2ebcb2f.poster.avif?t=1748011806\" width=624 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/extras/00360ab16c541913c0b96835d2ebcb2f.webm?t=1748011806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/extras/00360ab16c541913c0b96835d2ebcb2f.mp4?t=1748011806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every move counts, and precision in jumping is essential in <i>Condemned: No Escape</i>.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combination of precise jumps and puzzle-solving makes each stage require not only agility but also careful analysis of the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering these mechanics offers a highly rewarding sense of achievement, especially as the secrets of the place are unveiled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mistake can be costly, making precision one of the most important elements for success in your escape.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a world of adventure and puzzles in this game that pays tribute to the Game Boy era!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/extras/047ada9317048497f59bcfa3927fec83.poster.avif?t=1748011806\" width=582 height=516 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/extras/047ada9317048497f59bcfa3927fec83.webm?t=1748011806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/extras/047ada9317048497f59bcfa3927fec83.mp4?t=1748011806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a mysterious place filled with secrets and challenges. Your mission is to use all your reasoning skills to discover the best strategy to collect keys, unlock doors, and reach the exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Each level brings new obstacles, requiring you to think creatively and quickly to overcome barriers and uncover hidden secrets.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a nostalgic and challenging experience, where every move counts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The path is full of dangers: holes, spikes, traps, destructive platforms, and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jumping on destructive platforms requires attention, as they disappear right after contact. Treacherous holes and hidden traps make every step a critical decision. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically placed levers unlock new areas, adding an extra layer of strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/extras/00360ab16c541913c0b96835d2ebcb2f.poster.avif?t=1748011806\" width=624 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/extras/00360ab16c541913c0b96835d2ebcb2f.webm?t=1748011806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/extras/00360ab16c541913c0b96835d2ebcb2f.mp4?t=1748011806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every move counts, and precision in jumping is essential in <i>Condemned: No Escape</i>.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combination of precise jumps and puzzle-solving makes each stage require not only agility but also careful analysis of the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering these mechanics offers a highly rewarding sense of achievement, especially as the secrets of the place are unveiled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mistake can be costly, making precision one of the most important elements for success in your escape.</p>",
    "short_description": "Condemned: No Escape is an adventure puzzle game inspired by the Game Boy era. Explore a mysterious place filled with destructive platforms, traps, and holes. Use your wits and precise jumps to collect keys, unlock paths, and uncover secrets as you try to escape.",
